---
const { active = false } = Astro.props;
const HeadingTag = active ? 'h1' : 'p';
---
<section class:list={["feature-workflow-panel","version-page"].concat(active ? ['is-active'] : [])} data-feature-panel="ReviseArtwork" hidden={!active}>
<section class="version-hero">
    <div class="version-hero-image" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/assets/features/version-control/version-control-hero-inline.png" alt="Latino model wearing a branded PromoPlus hoodie with three clearly identified artwork states">
      <span class="proof-chip proof-chip-one">V1 · Original</span>
      <span class="proof-chip proof-chip-two">V2 · Revised</span>
      <span class="proof-chip proof-chip-three">V3 · Approved</span>
      <div class="version-hero-story"><small>Version history</small><b>Every change stays attached to the same product.</b></div>
    </div>
    <div class="version-hero-copy">
      <HeadingTag data-feature-heading class="feature-kicker">Artwork version control for promotional product proofs</HeadingTag>
      <h2>Every revision stays <em>clear.</em></h2>
      <p class="feature-lede">Every revision is automatically saved. Track changes, compare versions, restore previous artwork, and always know which version was approved.</p>
      <div class="feature-actions">
               <a class="feature-primary" href="/contact">Talk to Sales <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="version-problem feature-shell">
    <div class="version-problem-heading">
      <p class="feature-kicker">The problem with “final”</p>
      <h2>When versions live in filenames, certainty disappears.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="filename-chaos" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>design_final.pdf</span>
      <span>design_final_2.pdf</span>
      <span>design_FINAL_use-this.pdf</span>
      <span>design_client-edits.pdf</span>
      <span>design_latest-new.pdf</span>
      <strong>Which file was approved?</strong>
    </div>
    <p class="version-problem-copy">PromoPlus replaces guesswork with a complete revision record. Each change stays connected to its project, product, and approval history.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="version-lab" id="version-lab">
    <div class="feature-shell version-lab-heading">
      <div><p class="feature-kicker">Interactive version history</p><h2>Compare what changed. Keep what worked.</h2></div>
      <p>Select a revision to inspect its placement, status, and history. The approved version stays unmistakable.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="version-lab-stage">
      <div class="version-stack" role="tablist" aria-label="Artwork versions">
        <button class="version-card version-one" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-version="0">
          <span>V1</span><b>First placement</b><small>Original upload</small>
        </button>
        <button class="version-card version-two" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-version="1">
          <span>V2</span><b>Logo resized</b><small>Client revision</small>
        </button>
        <button class="version-card version-three is-active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-version="2">
          <span>V3</span><b>Placement refined</b><small>Current version</small>
        </button>
        <button class="version-card version-approved" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-version="3">
          <span>✓</span><b>Approved version</b><small>Locked record</small>
        </button>
      </div>
      <article class="version-inspector" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="inspector-top"><span id="inspector-state">Current version</span><b id="inspector-version">V3</b></div>
        <div class="inspector-art">
          <img class="inspector-product-image" src="/assets/promoplus/production-file-crop.png" alt="Original PromoPlus product proof showing the decorated Core Cotton Tee and production details">
          <span id="inspector-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div class="measure-line measure-horizontal"></div>
          <div class="measure-line measure-vertical"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="inspector-copy">
          <p id="inspector-note">Artwork moved slightly upward and aligned to the product center.</p>
          <dl><div><dt>Changed</dt><dd id="inspector-change">Placement</dd></div><div><dt>Status</dt><dd id="inspector-status">In review</dd></div><div><dt>Source</dt><dd>logo-final.svg</dd></div></dl>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="approved-lock">
    <div class="approved-lock-image"><img src="/assets/features/version-control/version-control-hero-inline.png" alt="Final approved PromoPlus hoodie proof secured as the current version"></div>
    <div class="approved-lock-copy">
      <p class="feature-kicker">Approved means identified</p>
      <h2>Always know which version was approved.</h2>
      <p>The selected proof moves forward with a clear status while older revisions remain available in the project history.</p>
      <div class="lock-status"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><small>Approved version</small><b>Protected from confusion</b></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="related-features feature-shell">
    <p class="feature-kicker">Connected features</p>
    <div class="related-grid pp-related-pair">
      <a class="version-related-link" href="/features/online-mockup-designer"><small>Create each revision in</small><h3>Online Mockup Designer</h3><p>Place, resize, rotate, and preview artwork in the browser.</p><span>Explore feature ↗</span></a>
      <a class="version-related-link" href="/features/customer-approval-portal"><small>Move the final version to</small><h3>Customer Approval Portal</h3><p>Give the client one clear version to review, comment on, and approve.</p><span>Explore feature ↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-final-cta" id="version-cta">
    <div class="pp-cta-copy"><p class="feature-kicker">Keep every revision clear</p><h2>Ready to stop guessing which file is final?</h2></div>
    <a class="feature-primary" href="/contact">Talk to Sales <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </section>
</section>
